1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,300
塔台，塔台。今天是7月15日。
Control, Control. Today is July 15.

2
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:12,000
空间站一切正常。
Space station: all normal.

3
00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:16,430
空间站一切正常。
Space station: all normal.

4
00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:17,520
什么？
What?

5
00:00:18,030 --> 00:00:19,230
什么呀？
What is it?

6
00:00:19,280 --> 00:00:22,100
塔台，塔台，12号汇报。
Control, this is Number Twelve.

7
00:00:24,920 --> 00:00:27,450
空间站一切正常。
Space station: all normal.

8
00:00:31,440 --> 00:00:32,800
没有外星人。
No aliens.

9
00:00:34,140 --> 00:00:35,420
没有外星人。
No aliens.

10
00:00:35,460 --> 00:00:36,950
什么外星人？
What aliens?

11
00:00:36,990 --> 00:00:38,600
没有外星人。
No aliens.

12
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:42,650
塔台，今天氧气消耗……
Control, today's oxygen consumption...

13
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:44,100
［数字不清］
[number unclear]

14
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:45,650
没有。
No.

15
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:55,600
［低声交谈，内容不清］
[quiet, indistinct conversation]

16
00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:02,750
塔台，塔台，我看见一只小鸟。
Control, I can see a little bird.

17
00:01:02,840 --> 00:01:06,550
停在房子旁边的树上。
On a tree beside the house.

18
00:01:06,610 --> 00:01:08,950
什么小鸟？哪有什么小鸟？
What bird? There aren't any birds.

19
00:01:09,920 --> 00:01:11,580
［交叠说话，内容不清］
[overlapping, indistinct speech]

20
00:01:12,100 --> 00:01:13,880
862号宇航员。
Astronaut 862.

21
00:01:14,870 --> 00:01:17,570
我要看你的心理检测报告。
I need your psychological test report.

22
00:01:17,610 --> 00:01:19,770
空间站上怎么可能有小鸟？
How could there be a bird up here?

23
00:01:21,950 --> 00:01:23,550
收到请回复。
Do you copy?

24
00:01:24,050 --> 00:01:26,650
862号宇航员，收到请回复。
Astronaut 862, do you copy?

25
00:01:31,910 --> 00:01:34,790
空间站没有小鸟。重复。
No birds on the space station. I repeat.

26
00:01:34,830 --> 00:01:37,200
空间站没有小鸟。
No birds on the space station.

27
00:01:37,870 --> 00:01:39,700
你要画小鸟？
You want to paint a bird?

28
00:01:42,620 --> 00:01:43,980
给你。
Here.

29
00:01:44,020 --> 00:01:45,250
给你画小鸟。
I'll paint you a bird.

30
00:01:45,290 --> 00:01:47,100
862号宇航员。
Astronaut 862.

31
00:01:55,420 --> 00:01:56,580
你去哪儿？
Where are you going?

32
00:01:56,620 --> 00:01:57,650
你在这儿。
Stay here.

33
00:01:59,100 --> 00:02:00,950
我这是翠绿，不是草绿。
It's emerald green, not grass green.

34
00:02:00,990 --> 00:02:01,970
翠绿。
Emerald green.

35
00:02:02,010 --> 00:02:05,960
862号宇航员，请立马结束你的任务返回。
Astronaut 862, end your mission and return
now.

36
00:02:08,760 --> 00:02:10,310
862号宇航员。
Astronaut 862.

37
00:02:10,810 --> 00:02:12,500
收到请回复。
Do you copy?

38
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:15,500
还有白色吗？
Any white left?

39
00:02:15,640 --> 00:02:16,490
有啊。
Yes.

40
00:02:16,530 --> 00:02:18,100
我跟你说，是白色。
I told you, it's white.

41
00:02:19,350 --> 00:02:20,830
我跟你说，是白色。
I told you, it's white.

42
00:02:21,040 --> 00:02:22,470
862号宇航员。
Astronaut 862.

43
00:02:22,510 --> 00:02:23,850
收到请回复。
Do you copy?

44
00:02:23,890 --> 00:02:26,220
否则飞船将启动自毁程序。
Or the ship will self-destruct.

45
00:02:26,260 --> 00:02:27,640
是白色吗？
Is that white?

46
00:02:27,940 --> 00:02:29,680
862号宇航员。
Astronaut 862.

47
00:02:29,920 --> 00:02:31,870
这是最后一次警告。
This is your final warning.

48
00:02:32,510 --> 00:02:34,150
收到请回复。
Do you copy?

49
00:02:34,180 --> 00:02:34,930
这盖是……
This cap...

50
00:02:35,020 --> 00:02:39,080
你们两个太不紧张了。
Neither of you seems tense enough.

51
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:39,940
尤其是你。
Especially you.

52
00:02:39,980 --> 00:02:41,080
他看不到。
He can't see it.

53
00:02:41,200 --> 00:02:42,320
你说的是谁？
Who do you mean?

54
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:43,710
子丑。
Zichou.

55
00:02:44,920 --> 00:02:47,710
你就完全把那个声音忽视掉了。
You're completely ignoring that voice.

56
00:02:47,750 --> 00:02:49,270
那不行，你要有反应。
You need to react.

57
00:02:49,570 --> 00:02:51,010
我听不见那声音。
I can't hear it.

58
00:02:51,050 --> 00:02:51,880
对，你听不见。
Right, you can't.

59
00:02:51,920 --> 00:02:53,680
但你不能就完全地……
But you can't just completely...

60
00:02:54,050 --> 00:02:57,540
不然就有点……往下就有点太……［不清］
Otherwise it gets a bit... [unclear]

61
00:02:57,580 --> 00:02:59,000
那就再来一遍呗。
Let's do it again.

62
00:02:59,040 --> 00:02:59,700
行，行，行。
Okay.

63
00:02:59,740 --> 00:03:02,400
就稍微回应一下。
Just respond a little.

64
00:03:03,650 --> 00:03:05,330
862号宇航员。
Astronaut 862.

65
00:03:05,370 --> 00:03:07,280
862号宇航员，重复。
Astronaut 862. I repeat.

66
00:03:07,320 --> 00:03:09,570
我要看你的心理监测报告。
I need your psychological test report.

67
00:03:09,610 --> 00:03:12,420
空间站里没有小鸟。
There are no birds on the space station.

68
00:03:13,930 --> 00:03:14,820
你咋……
What are you...?

69
00:03:15,220 --> 00:03:18,050
862号宇航员，收到请回复。
Astronaut 862, do you copy?

70
00:03:20,850 --> 00:03:22,750
我是……［词语不清］
I'm... [unclear]

71
00:03:23,240 --> 00:03:24,930
我听不懂你讲话。
I don't understand you.

72
00:03:25,020 --> 00:03:27,300
我……我嫉妒，我……
I... I'm jealous. I...

73
00:03:28,490 --> 00:03:29,950
862号宇航员。
Astronaut 862.

74
00:03:29,990 --> 00:03:30,580
你说什么？
What?

75
00:03:30,620 --> 00:03:31,700
热爱艺术。
I love art.

76
00:03:31,740 --> 00:03:36,130
我不适合从事理性分析类工作。
I'm not suited to work involving rational
analysis.

77
00:03:36,170 --> 00:03:39,480
把你的心理监测报告发过来。
Send your psychological test report.

78
00:03:39,520 --> 00:03:41,750
我不太懂你在讲什么。
I don't really understand what you're
saying.

79
00:03:43,940 --> 00:03:46,660
我不太明白你的意思。
I'm not sure what you mean.

80
00:03:47,960 --> 00:03:50,080
862号宇航员。
Astronaut 862.

81
00:03:52,940 --> 00:03:54,750
我很郑重地告诉你。
I'm telling you very seriously.

82
00:03:55,100 --> 00:03:56,520
如果你再不回复……
If you still don't respond...

83
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:58,360
你别走了，你坐下吧。
Don't go. Sit down.

84
00:03:58,400 --> 00:04:00,380
我们将认定你为叛逃。
We'll treat this as desertion.

85
00:04:01,070 --> 00:04:02,260
没有叛逃。
I'm not deserting.

86
00:04:02,300 --> 00:04:03,000
我在……
I'm...

87
00:04:03,600 --> 00:04:05,300
你在干嘛呢？
What are you doing?

88
00:04:06,810 --> 00:04:09,010
修。我在修我的矿泉水瓶。
Fixing my water bottle.

89
00:04:09,050 --> 00:04:11,630
我的矿泉水瓶出现了一个很大的问题。
There's a big problem with my water
bottle.

90
00:04:11,670 --> 00:04:14,430
它的盖儿缺了一个角。
A corner of the cap is missing.

91
00:04:14,470 --> 00:04:16,660
发送你的心理监测报告。
Send your psychological test report.

92
00:04:16,960 --> 00:04:18,840
Oh no！出来了它。
Oh no! It's come out.

93
00:04:18,880 --> 00:04:20,610
怎么办？怎么办？
What do we do?

94
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:22,320
咱们这有纸吗？
Is there any tissue?

95
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:24,200
862号宇航员。
Astronaut 862.

96
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:27,070
你在干什么？
What are you doing?

97
00:04:27,930 --> 00:04:29,170
［笑声］
[laughter]

98
00:04:30,610 --> 00:04:31,640
我……
I...

99
00:04:34,450 --> 00:04:35,880
862号宇航员。
Astronaut 862.

100
00:04:35,920 --> 00:04:37,460
［交叠说话］不想去。
[overlap] Don't want to go.

101
00:04:39,150 --> 00:04:42,530
如果今天你不再上传你的心理监测报告，
If you don't upload your psychological
test report today,

102
00:04:42,570 --> 00:04:44,260
飞船将启动自毁程序。
the ship will self-destruct.

103
00:04:44,300 --> 00:04:45,490
这是最后一次警告。
Final warning.

104
00:04:45,970 --> 00:04:47,400
862号宇航员。
Astronaut 862.

105
00:04:47,440 --> 00:04:48,930
［交叠说话］不想去。
[overlap] Don't want to go.

106
00:04:49,710 --> 00:04:51,650
这个太……这个……
This is too... This...

107
00:04:54,400 --> 00:04:56,990
天哪，他已经失去了理智。
My God. He's lost his mind.

108
00:04:59,910 --> 00:05:01,310
好痒啊。
That tickles.

109
00:05:03,080 --> 00:05:05,110
［说话声，内容不清］
[indistinct speech]

110
00:05:10,810 --> 00:05:12,290
它发光了。
It's glowing.

111
00:05:22,620 --> 00:05:24,420
你在画什么？
What are you painting?

112
00:05:25,430 --> 00:05:26,460
这是什么笔？
What pen is that?

113
00:05:26,500 --> 00:05:28,500
这是什么画法？
What technique is that?

114
00:05:29,020 --> 00:05:30,100
［简短回应，听不清］
[indistinct reply]

115
00:05:36,400 --> 00:05:39,080
就是把笔倒过来用。
You just use the pen upside down.

116
00:05:42,410 --> 00:05:43,200
十。
Ten.

117
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:44,650
什么鬼？
What the hell?

118
00:05:44,690 --> 00:05:45,770
九。
Nine.

119
00:05:47,400 --> 00:05:48,160
八。
Eight.

120
00:05:48,200 --> 00:05:49,040
挺好看。
Looks nice.

121
00:05:49,110 --> 00:05:50,320
七。
Seven.

122
00:05:50,360 --> 00:05:52,100
这个真挺好看。
This really looks nice.

123
00:05:52,140 --> 00:05:53,050
六。
Six.

124
00:05:54,420 --> 00:05:55,430
五。
Five.

125
00:05:56,930 --> 00:05:57,760
四。
Four.

126
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:00,200
三。
Three.

127
00:06:01,220 --> 00:06:02,190
二。
Two.

128
00:06:03,310 --> 00:06:04,440
一。
One.

129
00:06:08,280 --> 00:06:10,840
黄色没有那个青色好看。
The yellow isn't as nice as the cyan.

130
00:06:12,480 --> 00:06:14,370
它是接近肤色。
It's close to skin colour.

131
00:06:14,410 --> 00:06:15,870
然后青色是一个对比色。
Cyan gives more contrast.

132
00:06:15,910 --> 00:06:17,260
它上色更稳。
It goes on more evenly.

133
00:06:18,470 --> 00:06:19,700
比较浅。
It's quite pale.

134
00:06:19,980 --> 00:06:22,190
不过我下次可以弄深一点。
I can make it darker next time.

135
00:06:22,230 --> 00:06:23,560
可以调一个颜色。
We can mix a colour.

136
00:06:24,320 --> 00:06:26,410
你再让颜色调一下。
Adjust the colour a little.

137
00:06:26,950 --> 00:06:28,170
不管它。
Never mind.

138
00:06:31,810 --> 00:06:33,510
你们这算戏剧吗？
Does this count as theatre?

139
00:06:33,670 --> 00:06:35,730
啥意思啊？
What do you mean?

140
00:06:36,490 --> 00:06:38,110
不是还在排吗？
Aren't we still rehearsing?

141
00:06:38,410 --> 00:06:40,500
我怕观众骂呀。
I'm worried the audience will curse us.

142
00:06:43,360 --> 00:06:46,020
那观众骂就让导演去磕头。
Then let the director kneel and beg
forgiveness.

143
00:06:46,060 --> 00:06:47,030
可以，可以。
Sure. Sure.

144
00:06:47,100 --> 00:06:48,400
反正我不是导演。
I'm not the director.

145
00:06:50,050 --> 00:06:53,700
你刚刚有听到什么倒计时在响吗？
Did you hear a countdown just now?

146
00:06:55,120 --> 00:06:56,730
我没听见。
I didn't hear it.

147
00:06:58,050 --> 00:06:59,090
听到了。
I heard it.

148
00:06:59,130 --> 00:07:00,140
你听到了？
You heard it?

149
00:07:00,180 --> 00:07:01,260
你们两个都听到了？
You both heard it?

150
00:07:01,300 --> 00:07:02,040
听到了。
Yes.

151
00:07:02,080 --> 00:07:03,850
你听到了什么声音？
What did you hear?

152
00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:05,240
微波炉。
A microwave.

153
00:07:05,280 --> 00:07:06,700
微波炉？
A microwave?

154
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:08,620
咱们这儿有微波炉？
We have a microwave?

155
00:07:08,660 --> 00:07:09,670
你在做饭？
Are you cooking?

156
00:07:09,710 --> 00:07:12,040
我刚才热了……矿泉水。
I just heated up... some bottled water.

157
00:07:12,650 --> 00:07:14,010
矿泉水？
Bottled water?

158
00:07:14,090 --> 00:07:14,860
哦。
Oh.

159
00:07:15,680 --> 00:07:17,360
那我想喝水。
I'd like some water.

160
00:07:17,850 --> 00:07:18,680
喝。
Have some.

161
00:07:19,040 --> 00:07:20,580
你过来，给你换一个。
Come here. I'll swap it.

162
00:07:20,620 --> 00:07:23,180
862号宇航员，你在跟谁说话？
Astronaut 862, who are you talking to?

163
00:07:23,740 --> 00:07:25,940
飞船上只有你一个人。
You're alone on the ship.

164
00:07:26,770 --> 00:07:27,870
换哪儿？
Swap what?

165
00:07:27,960 --> 00:07:30,100
我在喝我的……［末尾不清］
I'm drinking my... [unclear]

166
00:07:32,380 --> 00:07:34,480
那这样我是不是……［后半句不清］
So does that mean I... [unclear]

167
00:07:34,530 --> 00:07:38,240
［交叠说话，内容不清］
[overlapping, indistinct speech]

168
00:07:39,130 --> 00:07:40,540
什么……？［末尾不清］
What...? [unclear]

169
00:07:46,740 --> 00:07:51,450
如果你观察到自己的心理出现了问题，
If you notice any problems with your
mental state,

170
00:07:51,840 --> 00:07:53,890
在飞船的医疗室里，
there is medication

171
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:56,600
有治疗精神疾病的药物。
for mental illness in the ship's
infirmary.

172
00:07:58,430 --> 00:08:00,060
我们这趟旅程，
This journey

173
00:08:00,400 --> 00:08:02,270
是要前往月球。
will take us to the moon.

174
00:08:02,960 --> 00:08:05,470
你还记得你当初对我说过什么吗？
Remember what you told me back then?

175
00:08:07,640 --> 00:08:08,960
说过什么？
What did I say?

176
00:08:11,020 --> 00:08:12,970
什么？没说过什么。
What? I didn't say anything.

177
00:08:15,070 --> 00:08:16,940
是你说要去月球，
You said going to the moon

178
00:08:16,980 --> 00:08:18,810
是你毕生的梦想。
was your lifelong dream.

179
00:08:18,850 --> 00:08:22,150
我才让你当了这条飞船的船长。
That's why I made you captain of this
ship.

180
00:08:23,550 --> 00:08:25,240
你到时候演的时候……
When you perform it...

181
00:08:25,280 --> 00:08:27,070
那也说不定。
Who knows?

182
00:08:27,150 --> 00:08:27,950
行啊。
Okay.

183
00:08:28,310 --> 00:08:30,200
反正观众也看不懂。
The audience won't get it anyway.

184
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:31,170
绝。
Brilliant.

185
00:08:35,300 --> 00:08:36,300
你怎么了？
What's wrong?

186
00:08:36,340 --> 00:08:37,790
肚子疼。
My stomach hurts.

187
00:08:38,530 --> 00:08:40,520
那你要不去上个厕所？
Why don't you go to the toilet?

188
00:08:40,560 --> 00:08:41,860
嗯，好。
Yeah. Okay.

189
00:08:42,810 --> 00:08:43,650
行。
Okay.

190
00:08:44,460 --> 00:08:45,910
你这是什么东西？
What's this thing?

191
00:08:45,950 --> 00:08:47,280
为什么这儿有鱼？
Why is there a fish here?

192
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:49,960
这是纪梵希。
This is Givenchy.

193
00:08:50,470 --> 00:08:52,390
纪梵希是什么东西？
What's Givenchy?

194
00:08:53,380 --> 00:08:56,270
是一个女性……［后半句不清］
It's a women's... [unclear]

195
00:08:57,020 --> 00:09:00,180
我不知道，我不懂它什么意思。
I don't know. I don't understand what it
means.

196
00:09:00,860 --> 00:09:03,550
我这只有“女性”这两个词。
All I got was the word "women."

197
00:09:05,830 --> 00:09:08,250
我上厕所，拉屎去，你别给我画。
I'm off for a shit. Stop painting on me.

198
00:09:09,230 --> 00:09:10,800
你不能拉屎去。
You can't go for a shit.

199
00:09:10,840 --> 00:09:12,410
你真的要去啊？
You're really going?

200
00:09:12,450 --> 00:09:16,690
［笑声］
[laughter]

201
00:09:16,730 --> 00:09:17,790
你真要去？
Really?

202
00:09:17,830 --> 00:09:19,730
［笑声］
